   237|    <section class="hero">
   238|        <h1>Professional Medical Tourism Coordination</h1>
   239|        <p>We connect you with China's top hospitals—and stay with you every step of the way. The right hospital, the right doctor, and professional support from inquiry to recovery.</p>
   240|    </section>
   241|
   242|    <!-- Core Value Proposition -->
   243|    <section class="core-value">
   244|        <h2>Good Hospitals + Professional Coordination = Better Outcomes</h2>
   245|        <p>China has world-class hospitals. But accessing them on your own—navigating the system, communicating in a foreign language, coordinating logistics across multiple parties—is a real challenge. That's the gap we fill.</p>
   246|        <p>We don't just introduce you to hospitals. We manage the entire process so you can focus on your health.</p>
   247|        
   248|        <div class="value-grid">
   249|            <div class="value-card">
   250|                <h3>🏥 Top Hospital Resources</h3>
   251|                <p>We help you access 40+ top-tier hospitals across Beijing, Shanghai, Guangzhou, and other major cities. We know which hospitals excel in which specialties—and we match you with the right one based on your actual medical needs.</p>
   252|            </div>
   253|            <div class="value-card">
   254|                <h3>🤝 Professional Service</h3>
   255|                <p>Dedicated coordinators who know the system. Medical records translated accurately. Appointments arranged efficiently. Problems escalated quickly. We bring the professionalism that matching resources alone can't provide.</p>
   256|            </div>
   257|        </div>
   258|    </section>
