   260|    <!-- Our Service Process -->
   261|    <section class="services">
   262|        <div class="service-header">
   263|            <h2>What We Actually Do For You</h2>
   264|            <p>From your first inquiry to your recovery back home—here's how we support you at every stage.</p>
   265|        </div>
   266|        
   267|        <div class="service-row">
   268|            <div class="service-card">
   269|                <div class="service-icon">🎯</div>
   270|                <h3>Hospital & Doctor Matching</h3>
   271|                <p>We review your medical records and match you with the right hospital and specialist—not the most famous one, the one that fits your specific condition.</p>
   272|            </div>
   273|            
   274|            <div class="service-card">
   275|                <div class="service-icon">📋</div>
   276|                <h3>Medical Records Translation</h3>
   277|                <p>We translate your medical history, imaging, and lab results so your Chinese doctors have full context before your first appointment—not just a list of diagnoses.</p>
   278|            </div>
   279|            
   280|            <div class="service-card">
   281|                <div class="service-icon">📅</div>
   282|                <h3>Appointment Scheduling</h3>
   283|                <p>We coordinate directly with the hospital's international department to lock in your appointment dates before you travel. No arriving and waiting for days.</p>
   284|            </div>
   285|            
   286|            <div class="service-card">
   287|                <div class="service-icon">🛬</div>
   288|                <h3>Travel & Logistics Support</h3>
   289|                <p>Visa invitation letters, airport pickup, accommodation near the hospital—we help coordinate the logistics so you arrive prepared and can focus on treatment.</p>
   290|            </div>
   291|            
   292|            <div class="service-card">
   293|                <div class="service-icon">🗣️</div>
   294|                <h3>On-Ground Interpretation</h3>
   295|                <p>Our coordinators help you understand treatment options, ask the right questions, and make informed decisions—not just translate words, but advocate for you at key appointments.</p>
   296|            </div>
   297|            
   298|            <div class="service-card">
   299|                <div class="service-icon">💊</div>
   300|                <h3>Post-Treatment Follow-Up</h3>
   301|                <p>We stay in contact after you leave China. We help translate discharge summaries, coordinate remote follow-up with your Chinese doctor, and keep your home physician informed.</p>
   302|            </div>
   303|        </div>
   304|    </section>
